WEBVTT

00:00:04.967 --> 00:00:08.600
Talk, and your words land right in the app you're typing in.

00:00:09.967 --> 00:00:11.867
That's the TypeWhisper keyboard.

00:00:11.867 --> 00:00:14.767
Here's how to set it up and use it, step by step.

00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:16.733
First, switch it on.

00:00:16.733 --> 00:00:18.733
In TypeWhisper, open Settings,

00:00:18.733 --> 00:00:21.067
Keyboard, and tap Keyboard Enabled.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:24.233
In iOS Settings, under Keyboards,

00:00:24.233 --> 00:00:27.200
turn on TypeWhisper and Allow Full Access.

00:00:28.067 --> 00:00:30.000
iOS shows this warning for every

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.133
keyboard that asks for Full Access.

00:00:32.967 --> 00:00:33.933
Dictation needs it.

00:00:33.933 --> 00:00:36.567
It's how the keyboard and the app talk to each other.

00:00:37.433 --> 00:00:40.100
Now open a text field, here in Messages.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:43.000
The globe key takes you over to TypeWhisper.

00:00:43.633 --> 00:00:46.167
Tap the microphone, and TypeWhisper opens.

00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:48.667
That's on purpose.

00:00:48.667 --> 00:00:51.300
iOS doesn't let keyboards use the microphone,

00:00:51.300 --> 00:00:52.933
so the app records for them.

00:00:53.800 --> 00:00:56.900
Tap Messages at the top left to go back,

00:00:56.900 --> 00:00:58.967
or swipe as the hint shows.

00:01:00.967 --> 00:01:03.900
“Weekend plan: farmers market on Saturday morning,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:06.467
then call Grandma and finally fix the bike.”

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.367
Done talking?

00:01:08.367 --> 00:01:11.933
Tap the mic again, and your words land right in your message.

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:16.100
The next dictation starts right in the keyboard.

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:17.067
No app switch.

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.100
“And don't forget to book the train tickets for Friday.”

00:01:24.633 --> 00:01:28.200
After every dictation, TypeWhisper stays ready for five minutes.

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:29.400
In Settings, Keyboard,

00:01:29.400 --> 00:01:32.233
you can pick one to thirty minutes, or turn it off.

00:01:33.067 --> 00:01:34.533
Until that time runs out,

00:01:34.533 --> 00:01:37.200
the iOS microphone indicator can stay visible.

00:01:37.967 --> 00:01:41.033
While it's ready, you can also hold the mic, talk, and let go.

00:01:42.700 --> 00:01:44.867
“Running ten minutes late, see you at seven.”

00:01:48.533 --> 00:01:50.967
Above the keys, you'll find your formats,

00:01:50.967 --> 00:01:52.333
Quick Fix and snippets.

00:01:52.333 --> 00:01:53.900
And you can swipe to type.

00:01:56.033 --> 00:01:58.700
On iPad, the keyboard has its own key to hide it,

00:01:58.700 --> 00:01:59.800
at the bottom right.

00:02:02.633 --> 00:02:05.767
With a Magic Keyboard or another hardware keyboard on your iPad,

00:02:05.767 --> 00:02:07.400
TypeWhisper shows only its tools.

00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:10.200
The tools sit next to your keyboard:

00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:13.100
the microphone, your formats and the globe key.

00:02:13.100 --> 00:02:14.833
Type as usual, or just talk.

00:02:16.967 --> 00:02:18.567
“Can you bring the slides for tomorrow?”

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.267
If TypeWhisper does not appear next

00:02:24.267 --> 00:02:26.100
to your keyboard, open Settings,

00:02:26.100 --> 00:02:28.200
Accessibility, Touch, AssistiveTouch,

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:30.133
and turn on the onscreen keyboard.

00:02:30.733 --> 00:02:32.567
The mode itself is under Settings,

00:02:32.567 --> 00:02:34.667
Keyboard, Keyboard Mode: Full Keyboard,

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:37.400
Tools Only, or Tools Only with a hardware keyboard,

00:02:37.400 --> 00:02:38.633
which is on by default.

00:02:39.533 --> 00:02:41.033
One tip: the first time,

00:02:41.033 --> 00:02:44.467
preparing a local speech model can take a few minutes.

00:02:44.467 --> 00:02:47.233
Keep TypeWhisper open until it has finished.

00:02:47.867 --> 00:02:49.600
And while the keyboard stays ready,

00:02:49.600 --> 00:02:51.667
music and videos keep their normal volume.

00:02:52.267 --> 00:02:53.367
Tap, talk, done.

00:02:53.367 --> 00:02:55.200
Right where you are typing.

00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:58.567
Free on the App Store, for iPhone and iPad.
